	SAY NAME2 "Axe of the Ruin +3"
	SAY DESC "This wide, heavy axe gives way to jagged teeth near its tip, a serrated edge designed to rip and tear flesh. Little is known of the weapon's origin, but the elaborate grip marked with worn runes hints that it may have been crafted in ancient Unther.

STATISTICS:

